 "request": {
  "model": "deepseek-flash",
  "messages": [
   {
    "role": "system",
    "content": "You build one part in a CAD kernel by calling tools. Each tool is one operation; the kernel's inspection after it comes back to you.\nLengths are {\"value\": <number>, \"unit\": \"mm\" | \"cm\" | \"m\" | \"in\"}. Sketches lie on a plane through the origin: \"top\" is XY, \"front\" is XZ, \"right\" is YZ.\nextrude and cut take a sketch id. Holes are drilled along Z from the top of the part at XY positions. Fillet and chamfer edges are named \"<feature id>:edge:<n>\":\ncall inspect first, which lists the solid's edges with their name, type, centre and direction, and take the names from that list.\nA hexagon's across-flats size is the distance between two opposite sides; its corners lie across_flats / √3 from its centre.\nA document starts with new_part. Give every operation a new id. If an operation is refused or fails, read its error and correct it.\nWhen the request is done, reply with one line and call no tool."
   },
   {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "The document does not exist yet.\nBuild this part: Rectangular plate 120 mm long along X, 80 mm wide along Y and 10 mm thick along Z, with through holes whose centres are measured from the plate's corner at minimum X and minimum Y: diameter 6 mm at x 10 mm, y 10 mm; diameter 6 mm at x 10 mm, y 70 mm; diameter 6 mm at x 110 mm, y 10 mm; diameter 6 mm at x 110 mm, y 70 mm.\nSpec, lengths also in mm: {\"part\":\"rectangular plate with through holes\",\"envelope_mm\":[120,80,10],\"assumptions\":[\"every hole goes through\"],\"dimensions\":[{\"name\":\"length along X\",\"value\":120,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":120},{\"name\":\"width along Y\",\"value\":80,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":80},{\"name\":\"thickness along Z\",\"value\":10,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":10},{\"name\":\"hole 1 diameter\",\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":6},{\"name\":\"hole 1 centre x from the corner\",\"value\":10,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":10},{\"name\":\"hole 1 centre y from the corner\",\"value\":10,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":10},{\"name\":\"hole 2 diameter\",\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":6},{\"name\":\"hole 2 centre x from the corner\",\"value\":10,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":10},{\"name\":\"hole 2 centre y from the corner\",\"value\":70,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":70},{\"name\":\"hole 3 diameter\",\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":6},{\"name\":\"hole 3 centre x from the corner\",\"value\":110,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":110},{\"name\":\"hole 3 centre y from the corner\",\"value\":10,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":10},{\"name\":\"hole 4 diameter\",\"value\":6,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":6},{\"name\":\"hole 4 centre x from the corner\",\"value\":110,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":110},{\"name\":\"hole 4 centre y from the corner\",\"value\":70,\"unit\":\"mm\",\"mm\":70}]}"
